  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet-knight",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Prudence Cray, Lantern Court customs. A knight: good. A respectable witness is worth three ledgers on this quay. Stand where I can see you, and tell me what you carry.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "greet-archer",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Inspector Cray. You have good eyes, I'd wager. This harbour hides more tonnage than it declares. Count me the ships at the pool and I shall count you honest.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "greet-sorcerer",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Halt. Prudence Cray, Lantern Court. You have the look of the restricted schools about you. Spellbooks, scrolls, anything bound without a licence: I shall be searching you.",
      "next": "sorcerer-search"
    },
    {
      "id": "greet-thief",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Inspector Cray. Customs. I have not searched you yet, which is odd, as I feel I should have. I cannot say why I have not. It is bothering me enormously.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "greet-any",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Inspector Prudence Cray, Lantern Court, customs. State your cargo, your business and your licence, in that order. I write everything down.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "welcome-back",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "You again. Good. Declarations are quicker when one has been through them once. Proceed.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "sorcerer-search",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Restricted school, unlicensed binding, no writ: it stays with me. You may visit it. Or submit to the search now, and be spared the indignity of my guessing.",
      "next": "sorcerer-choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "sorcerer-choice",
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "submit-sorcerer",
          "text": "Search me, then.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "playerClass",
            "class": "sorcerer"
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "search-fx"
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse-sorcerer",
          "text": "I carry nothing restricted.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "playerClass",
            "class": "sorcerer"
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "search-refused"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "search-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.searched",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.confiscate",
          "data": {
            "scope": "restricted-spellbooks",
            "exclude": "plot-critical,forbidden-plot",
            "route": "strongroom"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "books.impounded",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "search-done"
    },
    {
      "id": "search-done",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Thank you. Receipt attached; confiscated lore goes to the strongroom and may be visited. I take restricted spellbooks only. Anything sealed, or anything that matters to the Court's own business, I leave alone.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "search-refused",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Then you will not mind my looking, and I shall record that you did. I do not confiscate what is not restricted, nor anything under a seal I cannot break. Move along, Sorcerer.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "hub",
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ask-customs",
          "text": "What does the customs house do?",
          "once": true,
          "next": "customs-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-writ",
          "text": "Is there any way to get my books back?",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "playerClass",
                "class": "sorcerer"
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.writ.offered"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "writ-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-bay-nine",
          "text": "What do you make of bay nine?",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.bay-nine.suspicion"
                }
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.seizure.agreed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "next": "bay-nine-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-seal",
          "text": "You've noticed something about its seal.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "disposition",
                "npc": "npc-cray",
                "op": "gte",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.bay-nine.suspicion"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "seal-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "give-evidence",
          "text": "I have evidence about bay nine.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "any",
                "of": [
                  {
                    "kind": "fact",
                    "fact": "evidence.foundry-invoice"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "fact",
                    "fact": "evidence.honest-manifest"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "fact",
                    "fact": "evidence.dead-clerk-seal"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.seizure.agreed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "next": "evidence-route"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-release",
          "text": "About those impounded books. Off the record.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "fact",
                "fact": "cray.seizure.agreed"
              },
              {
                "kind": "disposition",
                "npc": "npc-cray",
                "op": "gte",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.books-released"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "release-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "bribe-purse",
          "text": "Perhaps a purse could speed the paperwork?",
          "once": true,
          "next": "bribe-purse-fx"
        },
        {
          "id": "bribe-fund",
          "text": "A donation to the Lantern Court widows' fund?",
          "once": true,
          "next": "bribe-fund-fx"
        },
        {
          "id": "offer-romance",
          "text": "I brought you reading material. For the evidence room.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "fact",
                "fact": "cray.romance-brought"
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.romance-accepted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "romance-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "witness-knight",
          "text": "If you need a witness, Inspector, call on me.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "playerClass",
            "class": "knight"
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "witness-fx"
        },
        {
          "id": "ledger-archer",
          "text": "I'll count your ships.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "playerClass",
            "class": "archer"
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "ledger-fx"
        },
        {
          "id": "nothing-thief",
          "text": "I have nothing to declare.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "playerClass",
            "class": "thief"
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "thief-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-crate",
          "text": "Is a crate of books being held here? Addressed to a bookseller in Briar Glen.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "not",
            "condition": {
              "kind": "fact",
              "fact": "books.impounded"
            }
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "crate-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-swap",
          "text": "About that crate. In the spirit of the evidence room.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "fact",
                "fact": "cray.romance-accepted"
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.books-released"
                }
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.books-traded"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "swap-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "present-writ",
          "text": "I have a writ for the impounded books.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "fact",
                "fact": "writ.held"
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.writ.accepted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "once": true,
          "next": "writ-check"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-regatta",
          "text": "Is magic really forbidden at the Regatta?",
          "once": true,
          "next": "regatta-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "That's all.",
          "next": "farewell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "farewell",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Good day. Mind the gangways. And do not mistake my courtesy for slackness.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "customs-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "We weigh, we stamp, we confiscate. Restricted school, unlicensed binding, no writ. It stays with me. You may visit it. Everything else, we merely tax.",
      "next": "customs-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "customs-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "I read what I confiscate, naturally. Due diligence. One cannot judge a book unread. That the shelf in my office is well-thumbed is a matter of professional thoroughness.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "A writ may be requested by post to the capital. It will be considered in six to eight months. Meanwhile, a council chair may sign one, at a price, or a forger. I did not say that.",
      "next": "writ-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.writ.offered",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.writ-explained"
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "bay-nine-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Bay nine is Vane Deepworks'. Stone, declared. Heavy, sealed and stamped. I have no cause to open it. Bring me cause, and I will open it before the tide turns.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "seal-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Since you ask, and since you have not tried to buy me: the stamp on bay nine's seal is a clerk's. The clerk was buried a year ago. A dead man has been certifying Vane's stone. Bring me proof.",
      "next": "seal-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "seal-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.bay-nine.suspicion",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.suspicion-shared"
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-purse-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.bribe.attempted",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": -6
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.bribe-recorded",
          "data": {
            "method": "purse"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "bribe-purse-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-purse-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "A purse. Offered to an officer of the Lantern Court, on the customs quay, in daylight. That is an offence, and I am writing it down. There. It is in the ledger. Do you wish to sign it?",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-fund-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.bribe.attempted",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": -6
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.bribe-recorded",
          "data": {
            "method": "fund"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "bribe-fund-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-fund-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "The widows' fund is audited by my own hand, and no coin has ever reached it this way. Magnificent try. I record it under attempted corruption. Your name is spelled as spoken.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "romance-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "This is not a bribe. I want that understood. I shall log it as contraband for the evidence room, where it will be kept with care. Thoroughly read. For the file. ... Thank you.",
      "next": "romance-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "romance-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.romance-accepted",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.romance-brought",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 10
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.romance-received"
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "witness-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 3
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.witness-registered"
        }
      ],
      "next": "witness-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "witness-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Noted. I shall enter you as an independent witness. Honest knights are few, and rarer in Wendmouth than frost.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "ledger-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.ledger.counting",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 3
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.ledger-offered"
        }
      ],
      "next": "ledger-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ledger-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Excellent. Report by name, tonnage and flag, at dusk. If a ship leaves that I have not logged, I shall know it was your miscount. I shall be gracious, but I shall know.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "thief-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Nothing. Yes. Quite. And yet I can tell I have not caught you at anything, which I find offensive. Move along, and move along slowly, so I can watch you do it.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence-route",
      "kind": "branch",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "fact": "evidence.dead-clerk-seal"
          },
          "next": "ev-seal"
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "fact": "evidence.foundry-invoice"
          },
          "next": "ev-invoice"
        }
      ],
      "else": "ev-manifest"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-seal",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "A stamp from the dead clerk's own hand. A year dead, and he certified last week's stone. Mr. Vane keeps strange clerks. This is cause enough for anything.",
      "next": "ev-accept"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-invoice",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Forty brass trinkets, 'goblin style, stamp as sample'. Over the sea, brass is brass. Here it is evidence of a crime. This goes into my files. Under seal.",
      "next": "ev-accept"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-manifest",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "A second manifest, honestly kept. It disagrees with the first on every line. Stone does not weigh what bay nine's crates weigh. This is cause. Procedure is on your side now.",
      "next": "ev-accept"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-accept",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.seizure.agreed",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.evidence-given",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 8
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.seizure-opened",
          "data": {
            "target": "bay-nine"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "ev-done"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-done",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "I will seize bay nine's crate, lawfully, at the hoist, with witnesses and a seal of my own. That is what I do. If the Tern sails first, I will keep this copy. Go.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "The impounded books are... I cannot release them. A release in gratitude, however, is a matter of discretion. Off the record. Take them before I remember my duties.",
      "next": "release-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.books-released",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 2
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.books-released",
          "data": {
            "scope": "impounded-crate"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "cold-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "You have a file, and it is not thin. I will not trade pleasantries. I will accept evidence, for the law does not care for my feelings. Otherwise, good day.",
      "next": "cold-hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "cold-hub",
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "cold-evidence",
          "text": "I have evidence about bay nine.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "any",
                "of": [
                  {
                    "kind": "fact",
                    "fact": "evidence.foundry-invoice"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "fact",
                    "fact": "evidence.honest-manifest"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "fact",
                    "fact": "evidence.dead-clerk-seal"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "not",
                "condition": {
                  "kind": "fact",
                  "fact": "cray.seizure.agreed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "next": "evidence-route"
        },
        {
          "id": "cold-leave",
          "text": "I'll go.",
          "next": "cold-farewell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cold-farewell",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Do.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "crate-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Crate seven. Consigned to M. Thorne, bookseller, Briar Glen: eleven volumes, one of them Restricted. Illusion. No writ, therefore held. You may visit it. I have visited it a good deal, in the interests of diligence.",
      "next": "crate-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "crate-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "A writ will release it. So will other lawful considerations. I am not permitted to enumerate the unlawful ones, though I observe that people in Wendmouth appear to know them without my help.",
      "next": "crate-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "crate-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "books.impounded",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "books.impound-told"
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "swap-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Reading material is not currency. I wish that understood. However. A person who brings the Court such... thoughtful reading has shown good character, and there is a crate that I have never seen leave. Nor, I think, will you.",
      "next": "swap-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "swap-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.books-traded",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 3
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.books-traded",
          "data": {
            "scope": "impounded-crate"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-check",
      "kind": "branch",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "all",
            "of": [
              {
                "kind": "factCmp",
                "fact": "writ.source",
                "op": "eq",
                "value": "forged"
              },
              {
                "kind": "fact",
                "fact": "cray.bribe.attempted"
              }
            ]
          },
          "next": "writ-rejected-1"
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "factCmp",
            "fact": "writ.source",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "forged"
          },
          "next": "writ-forged-1"
        }
      ],
      "else": "writ-vane-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-vane-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Signed, H. Vane, chair of the Council of Briar Glen. Valid on its face. I observe that Mr. Vane signs for coin, and that he is the consignor of bay nine. I accept it. I shall be thinking, quietly, about what else he signs.",
      "next": "writ-vane-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-vane-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.writ.accepted",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "writ.held",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.writ-accepted",
          "data": {
            "source": "vane"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-forged-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "A Lantern seal. The wax is the correct red and the crown stands on the correct side of the lamp. Quite excellent. I shall make a note of the correct side, for future reference. Release is authorised.",
      "next": "writ-forged-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-forged-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.writ.accepted",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "writ.held",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.writ-accepted",
          "data": {
            "source": "forged"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-rejected-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "You offered me a purse, and now you offer me a writ that happens to be exactly what I would have asked for. I compared it with the register. The crown is on the wrong side of the lamp. That is a forgery, and I am writing it down.",
      "next": "writ-rejected-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "writ-rejected-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.writ.rejected",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "writ.held",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.disposition",
          "value": "wary"
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": -4
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "cray.writ-rejected"
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "regatta-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Rule four. The stewards are volunteers and are drunk, so the rule is unenforced. I enforce it when I am walking past, which I do at the start, the turn and the finish. I say this in no sense as advice.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "fine-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Halt. You used magic in the Regatta, in front of a Lantern Court officer, and a rule that nobody enforces has just been enforced. Your win is void. The fine is ten crowns.",
      "next": "fine-choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "fine-choice",
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "pay-fine",
          "text": "Here: ten crowns.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "gold",
            "op": "gte",
            "value": 10
          },
          "next": "fine-paid-fx"
        },
        {
          "id": "owe-fine",
          "text": "I haven't got ten crowns.",
          "next": "fine-owed-fx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fine-paid-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "gold",
          "delta": -10
        },
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "tidefair.regatta.fine-paid",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "regatta-fine-settled",
          "data": {
            "how": "paid"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "fine-paid-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fine-paid-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Receipt attached. Ten crowns, paid in full, without argument. It was, if I may say so, a very handsome Gust. I did not say that.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "fine-owed-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "tidefair.regatta.fine-owed",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": -1
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "regatta-fine-settled",
          "data": {
            "how": "owed"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "fine-owed-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fine-owed-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Then it is a debt, entered in the ledger with your name spelled as spoken. I shall collect it. I always do.",
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "ribbon-route",
      "kind": "branch",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "fact": "tidefair.pocket.cray-caught"
          },
          "next": "ribbon-caught-1"
        }
      ],
      "else": "ribbon-lifted-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ribbon-lifted-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "My ribbon is gone. I did not feel it go. Nobody has ever once relieved me of anything in this harbour, and now it has happened before two hundred people. Keep it. I shall write a very long report on my own pockets.",
      "next": "ribbon-lifted-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "ribbon-lifted-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.lifted-told",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 2
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "ribbon-caught-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "My hand was on your wrist before it left my coat. I have been waiting for this all season. Let it be known that Lantern Court pockets are not a game, and also that you were rather good.",
      "next": "ribbon-caught-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "ribbon-caught-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.lifted-told",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": -2
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "theft-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "Someone has been in my strongroom. The lock is undisturbed. The grille is undisturbed. The books are not. I do not ask how you are involved, as I assume you will say you are not. I do ask that you note I have noticed.",
      "next": "theft-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "theft-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.theft-noted",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "thanks-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "cray",
      "text": "A moment. For the record: the matter of the crate was settled to the Court's satisfaction, or near enough that I have chosen not to look closely. You have been, on balance, useful. I do not say so often. I shall not say it twice.",
      "next": "thanks-fx"
    },
    {
      "id": "thanks-fx",
      "kind": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "setFact",
          "fact": "cray.thanked",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "disposition",
          "npc": "npc-cray",
          "delta": 1
        }
      ],
      "next": "hub"
    }
  ]
}
